| detector | Concept slope on `log(Γ)` | `se_bootstrap` | p-value | `se_boot / se_ols` |
| -------- | ------------------------- | -------------- | ------- | ------------------ |
| CUSUM    | −0.0629                   | 0.0502         | 0.2100  | **3.714**          |
| PHT      | −0.0270                   | 0.0524         | 0.6068  | **5.043**          |
