| `0.50` | `96.60 %`           | `96.65 %`              | `97.10 %`              | `−0.87`                                      |

The predictions at the **measured** `q` are within `0.8` standard errors of those at `q*` at every
grid point, so the campaign does not separate the standardisation constant from the measured rate,
and neither the constants nor the detector is indicted.

**Which of the two exact operators the float comparison implements is measured, not assumed.** Over
all 4 000 streams the realised level of `float M > 15.0` is `0.402`, of the exact `M_units > 75` is
`0.3925`, and of the exact `M_units ≥ 75` is `0.402`: **38 disagreements with the strict operator and
0 with the weak one**, all 38 boundary streams counted as exceedances. The identity is **empirical,
not structural**, and is stated for this threshold, this horizon and this accumulation order only.

**Panel B's arms are read against a nominal level this detector cannot reach.** Control C8 pushes
