symmetric about zero `E[1{ε<0}] = 1/2`, so the GJR second-moment condition is
`α + γ_lev/2 + β < 1`, which at `γ_lev = 0.28` is `0.99`. Every unconditional quantity at that point
is estimated on a process whose autocovariances decay at `0.99^h`.

