## Reported and not registered

**The two orphan CSVs have no producing script.** `expA_argarch_boundary.csv` and
`expB_race_condition.csv` were delivered with the attachment set; a grep of the whole delivery for
`argarch_boundary|race_condition` returns only the prompt. They are vendored verbatim under
