camera-ready candidate is opened on either.**

- Control C3 **reads** `expA_argarch_boundary.csv` and recovers its arithmetic exactly: both intervals
  are Wilson score intervals at `n = 1000` and `z = Φ⁻¹(0.975) = 1.959963984540054`, reproduced to all
