## Known deviations from the submitted manuscript

One entry is registered in `docs/DEVIATIONS.md`.

**`R14-campaign-redraw` — L345, Class A, D2.** Preamble §S6 requires migrating the delivered
`RandomState(100 / 200 / 201 / 300)` draws to a 128-bit `SeedSequence` keyed on role and index
alone. Three numerals of the quasi-Gaussian control move at v87's printing precision:

| v87 L345  | printed | regenerated |
| --------- | ------- | ----------- |
| lower end | `0.98`  | **`0.95`**  |
| upper end | `1.14`  | **`1.24`**  |
| mean      | `1.06`  | **`1.04`**  |

